 @AJ-po6up  The thing is though 12GB at 128gbit bus speeds is worse than 6GB at 256gbit bus speeds.

That is why it is a gimmick, the ram is fast but the bus is slow.  That means fast paced games will not get the chance to use any of it, because by the time those cached frames are generated they need to be USED lol so that empties the frame buffer quicker than you'll fill up the 6GB nevermind any more.

Do you see what I mean, you can't just shove a bigger wheels on a car and tell people it's gonna make them go faster unless the thing driving the wheels can turn them faster...

